TAll.Every  All.pas:1-90 (90 lines)
! parse errors at L3, L4
! conditional code: 2 {$IF…} regions, all branches shown
! hidden directive block at L12
! anonymous methods not analysed
objects: A TObj L5 freed on all paths; B TObj L6 NOT freed on all paths (escapes via L10 exception, L15 exit, L18 falls off end, L20 re-created, …) — verify L6-20; Result TObj L7 not freed in this routine (returned as Result: caller owns); FItems TObj L8 not freed in this routine (assigned to a non-local: owner frees); C TObj L9 not freed in this routine (no free found: leak candidate) — verify L9-90; D TObj L10 unknown (reassigned at L12) — verify L10-12; E TObj L11 unknown (creation not in CFG) — verify L11-90
